WEBVTT

00:00:29.825 --> 00:00:31.659
nuk me eshte dashur nje diete,

00:00:31.659 --> 00:00:34.330
me eshte dashur nje konsulent i modes.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:36.737
(Te qeshura)

00:00:36.737 --> 00:00:39.806
Por mendoja se duhet te humbja peshe,

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.268
dhe kur i rimerja,

00:00:41.268 --> 00:00:45.196
sigurisht fajesoja veten time.

00:00:45.196 --> 00:00:47.703
Dhe per tre dekadat ne vazhdim,

00:00:47.703 --> 00:00:50.458
kam qene ne dhe jashte dietave te ndryshme.

00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:52.530
Pavaresisht cfare provoja,

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:55.361
pesha qe humba gjithmone rikthehej.

00:00:55.361 --> 00:00:58.962
Jam e sigurte qe shume nga ju e njihni ndjenjen.

00:00:58.962 --> 00:01:00.523
Si nje neuroshkenctare,